OL,3,GNEWSATeenager prepares to swim the
OL,4,AChannel for charity
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 13-year-old boy is preparing to swim
OL,7,Fthe English Channel as part of a
OL,8,Fcharity relay with other students from
OL,9,Fhis school.
OL,11,FWill, from Cheddleton in Staffordshire,
OL,12,Fsaid his training had been going
OL,13,F"really well" and he was excited about
OL,14,Ftaking part.
OL,16,FOver the past year, he has done cold
OL,17,Fwater plunges, land training, early
OL,18,Fmorning and late night swims as part of
OL,19,Fhis preparation.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
