OL,3,GNEWSATeenager prepares to swim the
OL,4,AChannel for charity
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I've seen big changes this year with
OL,7,FWill," his mum Tina said. "He set his
OL,8,Fmind to do this and he's done it and
OL,9,Fit's just been an incredible journey."
